# Workflow Standards

Thin hub for development workflow, code review, and process requirements. Domain detail lives in child rules — do not duplicate here.

**Maintenance:** Never re-grow this file with domain bodies (git, agent behavior, platform, etc.). Extract new concerns to a sibling `.cursor/rules/<category>/RULE.mdc` and add one row to § Rule routing.

